    "pocketstation::codec::profile::StreamProfile::MusicStereo20ms: Represents the music stereo20ms alternative defined by `StreamProfile`.",
    "pocketstation::codec::profile::StreamProfile::MusicStereo10ms: Represents the music stereo10ms alternative defined by `StreamProfile`.",
    "pocketstation::codec::profile::StreamProfile::BroadcastStereo20ms: Represents the broadcast stereo20ms alternative defined by `StreamProfile`.",
    "pocketstation::codec::profile::StreamProfile::HifiStereo20ms: Represents the hifi stereo20ms alternative defined by `StreamProfile`.",
    "channels: Returns the channel count represented by `StreamProfile`.",
    "frame_duration: Returns the frame duration associated with `StreamProfile`.",
    "application: Returns the application held by `StreamProfile`.",
    "bitrate_kbps: Returns the bitrate kbps associated with `StreamProfile`.",
    "frame_ms: Returns the frame milliseconds held by `StreamProfile`.",
    "is_stereo: Returns whether stereo applies to `StreamProfile`.",
    "opus_config: Returns the opus config held by `StreamProfile`."
